Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:36.74,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Teleportation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I kicked the ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.45,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:47.04,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We can even think about winning the championship now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:50.13,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I didn't end up wasting money on that red shirt after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:57.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was praised...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:04.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I learned that move from Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:15.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want this ball to reach Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:22.24,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.37,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,The ball actually came to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.00,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You were able to reach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:37.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Try to stop the ball first like you just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No need to rush things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:42.89,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't we try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:44.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.02,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.10,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm open!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.56,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.40,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:54.15,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:55.07,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.37,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You were able to reach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.46,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It was so hot today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:22.59,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get changed as soon as I dry up,\N so head back to the classroom without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:23.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:38.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I guess no one's back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.20,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:48.45,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you seen Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:52.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's the bisque doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:56.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... Kurumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:03.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm... sorry, but the guys are still\N out there practicing for the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:05.34,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:08.97,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what I should do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:13.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's willing to talk to me as though we know each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:15.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:19.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason... she reminds me of Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:22.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:23.90,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:31.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You may not remember this, but you helped me\N pick up some printouts before. Thank you once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.16,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:36.25,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on. I just did what anyone would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:42.17,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of embarrassing to be\N thanked twice for something so minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:46.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, she's so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:50.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And really girly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:54.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The ideal girl I wish to become is standing right in front of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:06.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really, the more I look at her, she reminds me of a doll-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:06.24,Default-alt,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You remind me of a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.70,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:13.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I meant to say that out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.79,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, I'm the one who said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:16.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:19.75,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're Kuronuma Sawako-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:21.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She knows my real name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:25.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And wait, she just said I look like a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:32.56,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I do remember you from that day you were picking up those papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:37.23,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Because that's when I first got the\N impression that you looked like a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Like a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Like a doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Like a doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Like a doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:51.83,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.45,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We need to start heading to the field soon or we'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.37,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.68,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,She reminds me of a doll with hair that grows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Like a doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:21.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's... the first time anyone's ever said that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:28.32,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen, Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.95,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You look like you're in a daze there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:34.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:39.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was complimented, which doesn't happen very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.25,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! What did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That I look like a doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:51.64,Default,Misc,0000,0000,0000,,Sawadoo Doll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.64,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an6\blur1\fnComplete in Him\fs100\fscx80\c&H282246&\t(0,160,\c&H616AF0&)\pos(695,310)\clip(500,195,720,225)\t(30,350,\clip(500,195,720,395))}Sawadoo\N {\fscx90\c&H282246&\t(230,340,\c&H616AF0&)}Doll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:53.64,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if the person was really complimenting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:55.85,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,No... I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:58.60,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.40,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,We've got a pretty good chance in the tourney, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.52,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:05.86,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:12.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I knew there was something different about him. He's not wearing his vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:15.20,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,How are the girls doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:17.79,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.21,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako's really improved, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.12,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Improved?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:26.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:33.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:41.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-san came by to see you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.85,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:43.90,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.69,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what she needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.69,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It may have something to do with the festival committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:52.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so Kurumi-san is a committee member, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:55.03,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, you met Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:57.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, right after I left you to come back, Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:08:00.37,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,And there you go, using "Yoshida-san" again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:04.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Ch-Ch-Ch-Chizu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:08.46,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,On that topic, you and I both call her "Sadako", but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.05,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:14.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little difficult to change the way you call someone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.64,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I totally agree, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.52,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess we really don't have to\N change if it's going to be that much work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:24.40,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're Kuronuma Sawako-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:30.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah! If we ever have the chance to\N talk again, I'll try calling her by her first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:34.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try calling her "Kurumi-chan".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.57,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.00,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Have you memorized Sadako's full name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:47.46,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Kuroyama Takako.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.21,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.76,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little off, Ryu! Just a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.76,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,But I must say, that's not too bad coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:56.93,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I was pretty confident, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:58.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:08:59.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:01.97,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:05.52,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you demonstrate for him, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.65,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, tell Ryu what her full name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.36,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:18.91,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Then could you call her by just her first name this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.41,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:19.58,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.24,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,For practice, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:25.96,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako isn't used to being called by her first name or calling someone by their first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:31.88,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,It's just for practice to get her used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:00.66,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:04.33,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:08.37,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't expecting you to. It was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:13.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:15.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...made my heart beat so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:18.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like it's going to blow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-My heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:27.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it feels like I've been extra nervous around him since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:50.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:56.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I'm more nervous around him than I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.28,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.07,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:20.28,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Who's the girl he's talking with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.49,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think she's cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:23.74,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Is that something to say when your girlfriend's right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.79,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan wouldn't suit a guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:29.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.50,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think they're really cute together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.25,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:40.34,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,There's actually something I want to borrow from you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.34,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.01,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right! The album!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:45.35,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I totally forgot. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:45.85,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I even reminded you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.64,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry. I'll bring it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:51.73,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:52.19,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:53.27,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.40,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'll be sure to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:54.40,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry if I made you jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.32,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try not to forget. {cannot find this line anywhere before EOF -F}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:59.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Maybe I'll use her as my role model...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:02.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Her hair is so curly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:04.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Curly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Curly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:12.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,D-Do you think I'd look okay with a perm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Something curly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.96,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,A perm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.47,Default,Misc,0000,0000,0000,,Rawr! Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:26.18,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,A terrifying image just flashed through my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:29.39,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's a little late, but why do you wear your hair like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:34.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's because I thought longer hair would be more girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:37.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I do like girly things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:41.24,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnBelligerent Madness\b1\fs70\bord5\c&H1F1D20&\3c&HE7DDED&\clip(450,195,520,200)\t(0,670,\clip(450,195,520,610))\pos(478,203)}M\NA\NI\ND\NE\NN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:39.86,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.24,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:45.57,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, why don't you try dyeing your\N hair instead of trying to change the length?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:46.66,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! That sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.08,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you dye it brown?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Brown?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:52.70,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Brown...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:59.00,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't she look a little lifeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.34,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Want to get it permed a bit, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:03.80,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's that, a barmaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:06.47,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Then what about curls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:09.51,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,She looks like those delinquents from old films...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:24.07,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! I think you look fine the way you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:29.41,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! You should keep that look for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:30.49,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye, my curly dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wear my hair like this for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:42.55,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,But you've always worn your hair like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Basically, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:48.80,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you want to get it permed all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:55.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... thought that curly hair looked cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.89,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:59.52,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,So you want to look cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not because someone said I looked like a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:11.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I-I-It made me happy, but I'm not\N getting too carried away or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:13.62,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:15.54,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.33,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You've been practicing after school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:20.42,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you go and ask Pin for a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:21.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:25.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,How should I say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was a little envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan is so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was a little envious of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:41.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I wanted to be cute like her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:45.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't help but think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:52.12,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I know I'll never be nearly as pretty as her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:57.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to do the best I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:14:59.33,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hirano-san, Endou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.13,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,Call me Ekko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:05.21,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Tomo, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,E-Ekko-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,T-Tomo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:13.60,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you on your way to practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:18.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Ch-Chizu-chan and Ayane-chan went to get a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.40,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,A ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:25.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They said Arai-sensei may be willing to lend us one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:30.40,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! I'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:34.41,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,If it'll help us win, I don't care if you take five, or even ten, soccer balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:36.74,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need that many.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:39.87,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:41.83,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,With all our might!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:43.83,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:45.92,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,We'll defeat them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.38,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:48.76,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What is up with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:55.01,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, but I thought Ayane-chan was\N participating in the volleyball match with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:55.93,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:16:04.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She volunteered to help out, saying that\N it'll be easier to practice with three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:05.98,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.57,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:08.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:10.99,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,Let's both try our best to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:13.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.78,0:16:19.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,We're really... friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:25.50,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:26.96,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:28.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's been ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:29.67,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:31.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's... Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:36.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,People are always talking to him. He's so popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:38.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like he's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:41.85,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(960,960,960,1030,1250,1650)}Wait, why weren't you with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.85,0:16:44.56,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I had to attend the committee meeting for the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:48.15,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. You're really involved, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:51.44,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone from our middle school on the committee?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.94,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:17:00.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... so he calls her by her first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:08.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it, this may be the first\N time I've heard him calling a girl by her first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.46,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:14.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He can call her by her first name so naturally...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They must be really close...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:22.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What was that feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:31.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've never asked him before, but I wonder if Kazehaya-kun has anyone special?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:35.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if calling someone by their\N first name makes them special to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:42.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... feel a stabbing sensation in my chest...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.21,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ku-ro-nu-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:57.55,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to practice again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:04.31,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My chest starts to hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...just looking at his face...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:12.48,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:19.45,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My... chest hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:34.71,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,S...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:36.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.84,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:43.31,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,...wa...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:44.39,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:49.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's Kurumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:53.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:57.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Was he trying to say something...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:02.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...before Kurumi-chan called his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.08,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:06.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Let me join in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:07.12,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:08.87,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.51,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing, geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.72,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you? Weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:27.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... so it was just my mind playing tricks on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:31.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.82,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...that I'm worrying too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:36.73,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:42.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I'm thinking about Kazehaya-kun too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:49.25,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! Look at all that sweat, Sawako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The tension is leaving my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:56.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:13.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She really is nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:16.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:16.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:19.57,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,There. All dry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:24.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think... I'm a fan of hers now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:29.24,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I didn't even know they were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:33.37,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. Did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:34.37,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.17,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to chat with Sawako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.92,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm her fan, and she's my idol...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.13,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Sawako-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:44.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Your fan-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:47.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Fr-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.93,0:20:54.31,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:56.60,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...friends now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Friends?
